# Keep Docker build authority narrow: both repository Dockerfiles consume only
# these tracked source/config surfaces. Local state, Git history, caches,
# virtualenvs, receipts, databases, and credentials never enter the context.
**
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.swarm
!requirements-ginko.txt
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!dharma_swarm/
!dharma_swarm/**
!api/
!api/**
!scripts/
!scripts/runtime/
!scripts/runtime/dharma_swarm_container_runner.sh

# Never bake ignored/importable runtime artifacts into the sealed source tree.
dharma_swarm/**/__pycache__/
dharma_swarm/**/*.py[cod]
api/**/__pycache__/
api/**/*.py[cod]
